---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const title = "Poola Funding and Refunds";
const description = "Funding, contribution and refund information for Poola Pools.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-hero policy-hero"><div class="stripe-field stripe-field--small" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="container page-hero__grid"><div data-reveal><p class="signal"><span></span> Contributions</p><h1>Funding and refunds.</h1><p class="hero__sub">How monetary contributions, People Power commitments and refund requests should be handled.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container policy-layout"><aside class="policy-toc" data-reveal><h2>Legal links</h2><a href="terms.html">Terms and conditions</a><a href="privacy.html">Privacy policy</a><a href="cookies.html">Cookie policy</a><a class="is-active" href="refund-policy.html">Funding and refunds</a><a href="delete-account.html">Delete account</a></aside><div class="policy-content" data-reveal><article class="policy-card"><h2>Contribution basics</h2><p>Poola is designed for monetary contributions and People Power. People Power can include skills, time, resources, signatures, attendance and voice.</p><h3>Money contributions</h3><p>Monetary contributions may be processed by payment providers and may include the Poola fee of <strong>2.9% + 6 SEK</strong> per transaction.</p><h3>Refund requests</h3><ul><li>Refund handling can depend on Pool status, payout status, payment-provider rules and applicable law.</li><li>Pool Starters may need to answer questions about delivery, use of funds or campaign changes.</li><li>People Power commitments should be updated or cancelled by contacting the Pool Starter or support path shown in the product.</li></ul><h3>Disputes and reports</h3><p>If a Pool appears misleading, unsafe or fraudulent, users should report the Pool or contact Poola so the issue can be reviewed.</p><div class="policy-meta"><span>Last updated June 13, 2026</span><span>Support: info@poola.io</span></div></article></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
